ll material respects, and each such agreement shall be in full force and effect;", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm — Annex A, Article VIII, Section 8.2(d), page 47", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "On February 11, 2026, the parties executed Amendment No. 4 to the Amended and Restated Agreement and Plan of Merger and Reorganization to eliminate the closing condition that would have required Jet.AI to execute a new securities purchase agreement with a third-party investor, pursuant to which Jet.AI would have issued the investor a warrant to purchase up to $50 million worth of shares of a newly-designated series of preferred stock of Jet.AI.", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm — The Background of the Transactions, page 92", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status": [{"quote": "As filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on March 16, 2026", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm — cover page", "relevance_score": 3}, {"quote": "Pre-Effective Amendment No. 6 to
