• the Private Placement Investments having been fully funded in accordance with the respective Private Placement Subscription Agreements.", "location": "DEFM14A — The Business Combination — Conditions to the Parties’ Obligations to the Closing — Conditions to Each Party’s Obligations", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "Under the Business Combination Agreement, the approval by the CEPO Shareholders of the Business Combination Proposal and the Merger Proposal are conditions to the consummation of the Business Combination. If any of those Proposals are not approved by the CEPO Shareholders, the Business Combination will not be consummated, unless waived by the parties.", "location": "DEFM14A — Notice of Extraordinary General Meeting of Shareholders", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The obligations of Newco, Pubco, CEPO Merger Sub and the Seller to consummate (and cause to be consummated) the Transactions are subject to the satisfaction (or waiver, where permissible, by the Seller) of the following conditions:
