• the Sponsor having performed in all material respects its obligations required under the Sponsor Support Agreement.", "location": "DEFM14A — The Business Combination — Conditions to the Parties’ Obligations to the Closing — Conditions to Obligations of Newco, Pubco, CEPO Merger Sub and the Seller", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The obligations of CEPO and CEPO Subsidiaries to consummate (or cause to be consummated) the Transactions are subject to the satisfaction (or waiver, where permissible, by CEPO) of the following conditions:
