•non-objection of the Nasdaq Capital Market of the listing of the shares of CWB common stock issuable pursuant to the merger agreement on Nasdaq; and
•dissenters’ shares shall be less than 10% of the issued and outstanding shares of USB common stock.", "location": "communitywestbancshares-sx.htm, DESCRIPTION OF THE MERGER AGREEMENT, Conditions to consummation of the merger, page 85", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "Closing Conditions for the Benefit of USB. USB’s obligations are subject to fulfillment of certain conditions, including:
